<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 11.7 points to 886 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 11.7 points to 886 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 11.7 points on Thursday to 886.0, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the transport and energy indices rising the most, up 39.9 points to 1,331 or 39.6 points to 1,082 respectively.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
